    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">Reverse Trade Mission - Regional Middle East and North Africa Natural Gas, through Tavaci Partners, LLC</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">USTDA is funding a reverse trade mission (RTM) series to familiarize delegates from public and/or private energy entities in the Middle East and North Africa (MENA) region with opportunities for purchase of U.S. liquified natural gas (LNG) as well as the latest U.S. technologies, equipment, practices, and solutions for natural gas and LNG production, import, and transportation infrastructure. The RTM series would also facilitate opportunities for U.S. firms to connect with delegates and learn of upcoming market opportunities for LNG sales and for services and technologies procurements aimed at supporting exports of U.S. LNG to the MENA region.</narrative>
    </description>
