    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">This funding supports a series of two separate and distinct virtual Next Generation Technologies Workshops for the Middle East North Africa region to provide United States (U.S.) companies an opportunity to showcase their innovative technologies and solutions for next generation networks, including fifth generation (5G). The workshop series will provide support for regional governments and industry in planning for the deployment of reliable and secure 5G networks.</narrative>
